   "cooked": "<p>I changed the permissions so right now only people whith TECH tokens (just need 1 :D) can create a proposal. It should prevent spam at least for now since only hatchers have TECH in the future we could change it to have an X amount of TEC to prevent spam. Or at least if they wanna spam they should buy some tokens and fund our funding pool.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-full=\"true\" data-post=\"3\" data-topic=\"663\" data-username=\"AL0YSI0US\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"avatar\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/user_avatar/forum.tecommons.org/al0ysi0us/40/444_2.png\" width=\"20\"/> AL0YSI0US:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What will we do about these sorts of things?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>My personal feeling would be just ignored it, that being said people sometimes fall into those so we could also delete them if that’s what we think it’s the best. I think we shouldn’t delete them because on the real DAO we won’t be able to delete, we can’t protect everyone sometimes people learn the hard way  <img alt=\":man_shrugging:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/man_shrugging.png?v=10\" title=\":man_shrugging:\"/></p>",
